OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre reopens after
OL,4,Abacteria scare
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre that was closed after
OL,7,Fthe detection of Legionella bacteria,
OL,8,Fhas reopened following the installation
OL,9,Fof filters and being disinfected.
OL,11,FBeau Sejour Leisure Centre was closed
OL,12,Fon 15 September after routine testing
OL,13,Ffound the bacteria, which can
OL,14,Foccasionally cause Legionnaires'
OL,15,Fdisease.
OL,17,FThe centre reopened on Monday at 06:30
OL,18,FBST after the water system had been
OL,19,F"thoroughly disinfected".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
